---
import Figure from "../Figure.astro";
---
<Figure width="wide">
  <div class="two">
    <div class="fig" id="ctA"></div>
    <div class="fig" id="ctB"></div>
  </div>
  <Fragment slot="caption">
    <b>A randomised test of culture.</b> Left: the probability that a step succeeds, with and without a finding from
    another deme in the prompt, weighted by the inverse of each choice's logged probability. Right: the difference by
    phase of the run, with 95% intervals from a bootstrap over runs; each dot is one run's own difference, sized by its
    number of steps.
  </Fragment>
</Figure>
